            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsrayeli uyimvu ezingelwayo, exotshwa yizilwane. Kuqala wadliwa yinkosi yaseAsiriya, emva kwalokho uNebukadineza inkosi yaseBabiloni uqhobile amathambo akhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi yamabandla, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ithi: Ngizayitshaya inkosi yaseBabiloni lelizwe layo, njengalokho ngayitshaya inkosi yaseAsiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabuyisela uIsrayeli edlelweni lakhe, uzakudla eKarmeli laseBashani, lokufisa kwakhe kukholiswe emaqaqeni akoEfrayimi laseGileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalezonsuku langalesosikhathi, kutsho iNkosi, kuzadingwa ukona koIsrayeli, kodwa kungafunyanwa; kudingwe lesono koJuda, kodwa singafunyanwa; ngoba ngizabathethelela labo abayingcosana engibatshiyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
